      "title": "Verloop (rollend 8 uur)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tdengine-datasource",
            "uid": "vla-tdengine"
          },
          "queryType": "SQL",
          "formatType": "Time series",
          "sql": "select ts, `value` as v from idp.kpi where kpi_id='KPI-PRD-001' and `line`='$lijn' and ts >= $from and ts <= $to"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 60
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tdengine-datasource",
        "uid": "vla-tdengine"
      },
      "description": "KPI-PRD-001 · OEE\nFormule (catalogus): (run_hours / planned_hours) * (units_produced / ideal_units_at_run) * (units_good / units_produced) * 100\nBron in de demo: Batches per lijn: looptijd (unie van batchspans), geplande tijd (lijn 24/7 gepland), gevulde en goedgekeurde pakken; ideaal tempo per lijn uit KPI_IDEAL_PACKS_PER_H. Uren in procestijd.\nDoel 80, waarschuwing 70, kritiek 60 % (catalogus).\nUren zijn procesuren (demo draait 15x versneld)."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Over de gekozen periode",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tdengine-datasource",
            "uid": "vla-tdengine"
          },
          "queryType": "SQL",
          "formatType": "Table",
          "sql": "select (sum(case when `input`='run_hours' then `value` else 0.0 end) / sum(case when `input`='planned_hours' then `value` else 0.0 end)) * (sum(case when `input`='units_produced' then `value` else 0.0 end) / sum(case when `input`='ideal_units_at_run' then `value` else 0.0 end)) * (sum(case when `input`='units_good' then `value` else 0.0 end) / sum(case when `input`='units_produced' then `value` else 0.0 end)) * 100 as v from idp.kpi_input where kpi_id='KPI-PRD-001' and `line`='$lijn' and ts >= $from and ts < $to"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 60
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "geen data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
